[TITLE]
API-02: two reservoirs at the same head each supply one junction; trace from Lake

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     100     ; supplied by River
 J2   0     100     ; supplied by Lake

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID     Head
 River  100         ; node 3
 Lake   100         ; node 4, the trace node

[PIPES]
;ID  N1     N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  River  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  Lake   J2  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P3  J1     J2  1000    12    100    0      Open    ; no flow, the heads are equal

[TIMES]
 Duration            6:00

[OPTIONS]
 Units      GPM
 Headloss   H-W
 Quality    Trace Lake

[END]
